{%- comment -%}
  Form di ordinamento dei risultati. Condiviso da collezione e ricerca.
  Form a parte dal pannello dei filtri: funziona anche senza filtri. Senza JS mantiene i filtri attivi con campi
  nascosti e mostra il pulsante "Applica"; con JS <product-facets> legge solo la select (data-facets-sort).
  La condizione per mostrarlo (ordinamento attivo, risultati presenti) resta nella section.

  Parametri:
  - results: collection o search
  - section_id: id della section (id univoco della select)
  - action: URL del form (collection.url o routes.search_url)
  - sort_by: ordinamento attuale
  - terms: termini di ricerca (solo nella ricerca: input nascosti q e options[prefix])

  Uso: {% render 'facets-sort', results: collection, section_id: section.id, action: collection.url, sort_by: sort_by %}
{%- endcomment -%}
<form action="{{ action }}" method="get" class="flex items-center gap-2" data-facets-sort-form>
  {%- if terms != blank -%}
    <input type="hidden" name="q" value="{{ terms | escape }}">
    <input type="hidden" name="options[prefix]" value="last">
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- for filter in results.filters -%}
    {%- if filter.type == 'price_range' -%}
      {%- if filter.min_value.value != nil -%}
        <input type="hidden" name="{{ filter.min_value.param_name }}" value="{% render 'facets-price-value', amount: filter.min_value.value %}">
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if filter.max_value.value != nil -%}
        <input type="hidden" name="{{ filter.max_value.param_name }}" value="{% render 'facets-price-value', amount: filter.max_value.value %}">
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- else -%}
      {%- for filter_value in filter.active_values -%}
        <input type="hidden" name="{{ filter_value.param_name }}" value="{{ filter_value.value | escape }}">
      {%- endfor -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
  <label for="SortBy-{{ section_id }}" class="text-body-sm text-muted max-md:sr-only">
    {{- 'sections.collection.sort_by' | t -}}
  </label>
  <div class="relative">
    <select
      id="SortBy-{{ section_id }}"
      name="sort_by"
      class="h-9 cursor-pointer appearance-none rounded-button border border-input-border bg-input ps-3 pe-9 text-body-sm text-input-foreground transition-colors duration-150 hover:border-input-foreground focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary motion-reduce:transition-none"
      data-facets-sort
      data-default="{{ results.default_sort_by | escape }}"
    >
      {%- for option in results.sort_options -%}
        <option value="{{ option.value | escape }}"{% if option.value == sort_by %} selected{% endif %}>
          {{- option.name | escape -}}
        </option>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </select>
    {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-down', size: 16, class: 'pointer-events-none absolute inset-y-0 end-2.5 my-auto text-input-foreground/65' %}
  </div>
  <button type="submit" class="button button-neutral button-sm js:hidden">{{ 'sections.collection.apply' | t }}</button>
</form>
